    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Genealogy of Saul the Benjamite"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Benjamin was the father of Bela his firstborn,",
          "Ashbel the second son, Aharah the third,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Nohah the fourth and Rapha the fifth."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Bela were:",
          "Addar, Gera, Abihud,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gera, Shephuphan and Huram."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "These were the descendants of Ehud, who were heads of families of those living in Geba and were deported to Manahath:"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Naaman, Ahijah, and Gera, who deported them and who was the father of Uzza and Ahihud."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sons were born to Shaharaim in Moab after he had divorced his wives Hushim and Baara."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "By his wife Hodesh he had Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malkam,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jeuz, Sakia and Mirmah. These were his sons, heads of families."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "By Hushim he had Abitub and Elpaal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Elpaal:",
          "Eber, Misham, Shemed (who built Ono and Lod with its surrounding villages),"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and Beriah and Shema, who were heads of families of those living in Aijalon and who drove out the inhabitants of Gath."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ahio, Shashak, Jeremoth,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zebadiah, Arad, Eder,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Michael, Ishpah and Joha were the sons of Beriah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ishmerai, Izliah and Jobab were the sons of Elpaal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jakim, Zikri, Zabdi,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Adaiah, Beraiah and Shimrath were the sons of Shimei."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ishpan, Eber, Eliel,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Abdon, Zikri, Hanan,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          24
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          25
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Iphdeiah and Penuel were the sons of Shashak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          26
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          27
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jaareshiah, Elijah and Zikri were the sons of Jeroham."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          28
        ],
        "lines": [
          "All these were heads of families, chiefs as listed in their genealogy, and they lived in Jerusalem."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          29
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Jeiel the father of Gibeon lived in Gibeon.",
          "His wife’s name was Maakah,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          30
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and his firstborn son was Abdon, followed by Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          31
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gedor, Ahio, Zeker"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          32
        ],
        "lines": [
          "and Mikloth, who was the father of Shimeah. They too lived near their relatives in Jerusalem."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          33
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ner was the father of Kish, Kish the father of Saul, and Saul the father of Jonathan, Malki-Shua, Abinadab and Esh-Baal."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          34
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The son of Jonathan:",
          "Merib-Baal, who was the father of Micah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          35
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Micah:",
          "Pithon, Melek, Tarea and Ahaz."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          36
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Ahaz was the father of Jehoaddah, Jehoaddah was the father of Alemeth, Azmaveth and Zimri, and Zimri was the father of Moza."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          37
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Moza was the father of Binea; Raphah was his son, Eleasah his son and Azel his son."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          38
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Azel had six sons, and these were their names:",
          "Azrikam, Bokeru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah and Hanan. All these were the sons of Azel."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          39
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of his brother Eshek:",
          "Ulam his firstborn, Jeush the second son and Eliphelet the third."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          40
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The sons of Ulam were brave warriors who could handle the bow. They had many sons and grandsons—150 in all.",
          "All these were the descendants of Benjamin."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
